      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَحْبُورٌ</span></b> , applied to a man, [<i>Very happy, joyful,
glad,</i> or <i>cheerful;</i>] of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَفْعُولٌ</span> from
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحُبُورُ</span>: (S:) a <i>soft, tender,</i> or <i>delicate,</i> man:
pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَحَابِيرُ</span>. (AA, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <i>A certain bird:</i> or
the <i>male of the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُبَارَى</span>: or <i>its young one.</i> (K.)
See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُبْرُورٌ</span>.

